Dude.

3647
03:28:09,670 --> 03:28:11,750
Does that work on plasma cutter, too?

3648
03:28:13,330 --> 03:28:15,490
Makes plasma beams spell...

3649
03:28:15,490 --> 03:28:16,910
It better work.

3650
03:28:18,090 --> 03:28:19,010
It better work.

3651
03:28:20,050 --> 03:28:21,230
Let's get rid of...

3652
03:28:22,070 --> 03:28:24,130
um, that one.

3653
03:28:25,470 --> 03:28:27,050
I kind of want to buy...

3654
03:28:28,050 --> 03:28:28,750
this one.

3655
03:28:30,210 --> 03:28:30,930
To have.

3656
03:28:31,430 --> 03:28:32,450
