3762
03:36:23,700 --> 03:36:28,580
I don't think there was anything crazy here that I really would like.

3763
03:36:29,520 --> 03:36:31,300
Maybe the...

3764
03:36:33,360 --> 03:36:34,320
Maybe I'll take that.

3765
03:36:35,260 --> 03:36:36,440
Oh, let's try this!

3766
03:36:36,440 --> 03:36:37,660
Plasma beam enhancer.

3767
