Nah, it only works with a plasma beam, I guess.

3768
03:36:45,430 --> 03:36:46,410
It makes sense, I guess.

3769
03:36:47,250 --> 03:36:49,330
This is a plasma cutter, it's not a plasma beam.

3770
03:36:54,320 --> 03:36:54,760
Damn it.

3771
03:37:00,130 --> 03:37:00,890
