Dude, we're going.

3781
03:37:39,780 --> 03:37:41,860
Oh, I know you're angry, I know you're angry.

3782
03:37:43,180 --> 03:37:44,260
Too fucking bad.

3783
03:37:46,220 --> 03:37:46,380
Oh.

3784
