See, this is why you don't do it from memory.

3840
03:41:26,610 --> 03:41:27,210
Memory is bad.

3841
03:41:28,370 --> 03:41:29,510
Delete that.

3842
03:41:32,010 --> 03:41:32,030
Okay.

3843
03:41:33,390 --> 03:41:34,990
So it basically goes like this.

3844
03:41:35,310 --> 03:41:35,630
